					<style id="exjsx-raw-ykrhga-0">.elementor-element-e00000{margin:0 !important;height:0;line-height:0;}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e00004-s.e-ykrhga-e00004-s{text-transform: uppercase;}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e00005-s.e-ykrhga-e00005-s{text-transform: uppercase;}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e0000c-s.e-ykrhga-e0000c-s{text-decoration: underline;}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e0000h-s.e-ykrhga-e0000h-s{text-transform: uppercase;}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e00044-s.e-ykrhga-e00044-s{text-transform: uppercase;}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e0005l-s.e-ykrhga-e0005l-s{text-transform: uppercase;}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e0005o-s.e-ykrhga-e0005o-s{border-top-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-color: #DED5C6;}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e0005s-s.e-ykrhga-e0005s-s{border-top-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-color: #DED5C6;}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e0005w-s.e-ykrhga-e0005w-s{border-top-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-color: #DED5C6;}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e00060-s.e-ykrhga-e00060-s{border-top-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-color: #DED5C6;}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e00067-s.e-ykrhga-e00067-s{text-transform: uppercase;}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e0006m-s.e-ykrhga-e0006m-s{text-transform: uppercase;}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e0007h-s.e-ykrhga-e0007h-s{text-transform: uppercase;}.elementor .e-ykrhga-e0007p-s.e-ykrhga-e0007p-s{border-top-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-color: #DED5C6;}</style>				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00001 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00001-s " data-id="e00001" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00001">
    <section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00002 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00002-s " data-id="e00002" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00002">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00003 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00003-s " data-id="e00003" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00003">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e00004" class="e-ykrhga-e00004-s e-heading-base">Wren &amp; Ash</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00005-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00005">Furniture makers · Welsh borders · est. 2014</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00006 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00006-s " data-id="e00006" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00006">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00007 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00007-s " data-id="e00007" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00007">
    			<h1 data-interaction-id="e00008" class="e-ykrhga-e00008-s e-heading-base">Furniture made from trees we can point at.</h1>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00009-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00009">Two makers, one workshop in the Welsh borders, working in native oak, ash, elm and cherry from woodland within forty miles. Every commission is drawn, made and delivered by the same two people.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000a-s " data-id="e0000a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000a">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000b"><a href="#start" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Start a commission
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000c"><a href="#catalogue" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Or read the catalogue first
	</a></p>
		
</div>

</div>
			<img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0000d-s" data-interaction-id="e0000d" id="267" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-wren-and-ash-table_room.jpg" width="1024" height="576" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-wren-and-ash-table_room.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-wren-and-ash-table_room-300x169.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-wren-and-ash-table_room-768x432.jpg 768w" alt="A solid oak refectory table in a plain room"/>		
</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000e-s " data-id="e0000e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000e" id="catalogue">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000f-s " data-id="e0000f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000f">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000g-s " data-id="e0000g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000g">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000h">The catalogue — twenty-four pieces</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0000i" class="e-ykrhga-e0000i-s e-heading-base">Everything we have made since 2021, with the tree it came from.</h2>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000j">Nine commissions a year, no more. Where a piece shares a tree with another, we have said so — a bench and a table from the one Cwmcarn oak.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000k e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0000k-s " data-id="e0000k" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0000k">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000l-s " data-id="e0000l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000l">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000m">2025</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0000n" class="e-ykrhga-e0000n-s e-heading-base">Refectory table</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000o">2.8m</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000p">Pippy oak from a wind-thrown tree at Cwmcarn</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000q-s " data-id="e0000q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000q">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000r">2025</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0000s" class="e-ykrhga-e0000s-s e-heading-base">Dresser base</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000t">1.6m</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000u">Brown oak from a hedgerow tree at Llangattock</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000v-s " data-id="e0000v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000v">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000w">2025</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0000x" class="e-ykrhga-e0000x-s e-heading-base">Six dining chairs</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000y">seat 460mm</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000z">Ash from Coed Cefn</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00010 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00010-s " data-id="e00010" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00010">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00011-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00011">2025</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00012" class="e-ykrhga-e00012-s e-heading-base">Writing desk</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00013-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00013">1.4m</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00014-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00014">Cherry from an orchard at Wormbridge</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00015 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00015-s " data-id="e00015" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00015">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00016-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00016">2025</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00017" class="e-ykrhga-e00017-s e-heading-base">Blanket chest</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00018-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00018">1.1m</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00019-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00019">Elm from a churchyard tree at Grosmont</p>
		
</div>
