<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003x-s " data-id="e0003x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003x">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003y e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0003y-s " data-id="e0003y" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0003y">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003z-s " data-id="e0003z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003z">
    			<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e00040-s" data-interaction-id="e00040" id="268" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-wren-and-ash-timber_stack.jpg" width="1024" height="768" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-wren-and-ash-timber_stack.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-wren-and-ash-timber_stack-300x225.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-wren-and-ash-timber_stack-768x576.jpg 768w" alt="Air-drying boards stacked in stick in the timber rack"/>					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00041-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00041">We buy standing or wind-thrown trees, mill them ourselves, and air-dry for three years before anything is cut. There is a board in the rack now that will be a table in 2029.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00042 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00042-s " data-id="e00042" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00042">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00043 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00043-s " data-id="e00043" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00043">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00044-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00044">The rack, tree by tree</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00045" class="e-ykrhga-e00045-s e-heading-base">Six trees, and the year each one becomes furniture.</h2>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00046 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00046-s " data-id="e00046" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00046">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00047 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00047-s " data-id="e00047" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00047">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00048 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00048-s " data-id="e00048" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00048">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00049" class="e-ykrhga-e00049-s e-heading-base">Oak</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004a">Cwmcarn</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004b">Wind-thrown in the February gales. Pippy through the butt.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004c-s " data-id="e0004c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004c">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004d">Felled 2021</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004e">In the rack until 2024</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004f-s " data-id="e0004f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004f">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004g-s " data-id="e0004g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004g">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004h" class="e-ykrhga-e0004h-s e-heading-base">Ash</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004i">Coed Cefn</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004j">Standing, taken for dieback. Straight and pale, olive at the heart.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004k-s " data-id="e0004k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004k">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004l">Felled 2022</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004m">Ready now</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004n-s " data-id="e0004n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004n">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004o-s " data-id="e0004o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004o">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004p" class="e-ykrhga-e0004p-s e-heading-base">Elm</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004q">Grosmont</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004r">A churchyard tree the parish had to take down. Wild figure.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004s-s " data-id="e0004s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004s">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004t">Felled 2020</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004u">Ready now</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004v-s " data-id="e0004v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004v">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004w-s " data-id="e0004w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004w">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004x" class="e-ykrhga-e0004x-s e-heading-base">Cherry</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004y">Wormbridge</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004z">An orchard grubbed out for a new planting. Short boards, deep colour.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00050 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00050-s " data-id="e00050" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00050">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00051-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00051">Felled 2023</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00052-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00052">In the rack until 2026</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00053 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00053-s " data-id="e00053" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00053">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00054 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00054-s " data-id="e00054" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00054">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00055" class="e-ykrhga-e00055-s e-heading-base">Oak</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00056-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00056">Skenfrith</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00057-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00057">Brown oak, beefsteak fungus through two of the four butts.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00058 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00058-s " data-id="e00058" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00058">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00059-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00059">Felled 2024</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005a">In the rack until 2027</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005b-s " data-id="e0005b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005b">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005c-s " data-id="e0005c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005c">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005d" class="e-ykrhga-e0005d-s e-heading-base">Ash</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005e">Usk</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005f">Riverside tree, undercut and leaning. The board that will be a table in 2029.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005g-s " data-id="e0005g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005g">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005h">Felled 2026</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005i">In the rack until 2029</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005j-s " data-id="e0005j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005j">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005k-s " data-id="e0005k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005k">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005l">How a commission works</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0005m" class="e-ykrhga-e0005m-s e-heading-base">Four stages, and you are welcome at all of them.</h2>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005n e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0005n-s " data-id="e0005n" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0005n">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005o-s " data-id="e0005o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005o">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005p">01</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005q" class="e-ykrhga-e0005q-s e-heading-base">We visit and measure</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005r">We come to the room the piece will live in, measure it, and look at the light. No charge and no obligation — it is the only way to get proportion right.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005s-s " data-id="e0005s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005s">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005t">02</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005u" class="e-ykrhga-e0005u-s e-heading-base">A drawing and a fixed price</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005v">A hand drawing at a proper scale, with a fixed price against it. Nothing moves until you are happy with both. The price does not change afterwards.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005w-s " data-id="e0005w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005w">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005x">03</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005y" class="e-ykrhga-e0005y-s e-heading-base">Timber selection</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005z">We pick the boards out of the rack and lay them out. You are welcome to attend and most people do — it is the part where the piece stops being a drawing.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00060 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00060-s " data-id="e00060" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00060">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00061-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00061">04</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00062" class="e-ykrhga-e00062-s e-heading-base">Twelve to twenty weeks, then delivery</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00063-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00063">The two of us in the workshop, no subcontracting. We deliver and install it ourselves, in our own van, and take the packing away with us.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00064 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00064-s " data-id="e00064" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00064">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00065 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00065-s " data-id="e00065" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00065">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e00066" class="e-ykrhga-e00066-s e-heading-base">Detail plates: the joints, and the room they were cut in.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00067-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00067">Plates i &amp; ii</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00068 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00068-s " data-id="e00068" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00068">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00069 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00069-s " data-id="e00069" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00069">
    			<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0006a-s" data-interaction-id="e0006a" id="266" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-wren-and-ash-joinery_macro.jpg" width="512" height="512" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-wren-and-ash-joinery_macro.jpg 512w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-wren-and-ash-joinery_macro-300x300.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-wren-and-ash-joinery_macro-150x150.jpg 150w" alt="Close view of a hand-cut dovetail joint in oak"/>		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006b-s " data-id="e0006b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006b">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0006c" class="e-ykrhga-e0006c-s e-heading-base">Plate i — through-dovetail, oak</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006d">Cut by hand, sawn to the line and pared, no router jig. Finished in hardwax oil, not lacquer. It will mark, and you can fix it yourself with a cloth in ten minutes. That is the trade and we think it is the right one.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006e-s " data-id="e0006e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006e">
    			<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0006f-s" data-interaction-id="e0006f" id="269" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-wren-and-ash-workshop.jpg" width="768" height="1024" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-wren-and-ash-workshop.jpg 768w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-wren-and-ash-workshop-225x300.jpg 225w" alt="The two-person workshop in the Welsh borders"/>		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006g-s " data-id="e0006g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006g">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0006h" class="e-ykrhga-e0006h-s e-heading-base">Plate ii — the bench room</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006i">Two benches, one bandsaw, a rack of moulding planes that came with the building. Every piece in the catalogue above was made standing at one of these two benches.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006j-s " data-id="e0006j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006j">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006k e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0006k-s " data-id="e0006k" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0006k">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006l-s " data-id="e0006l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006l">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006m">Prices, honestly banded</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0006n" class="e-ykrhga-e0006n-s e-heading-base">Dining tables from 4,800. Chairs from 1,150 each.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006o">Bookcases and fitted work from 6,500. Deposits are a third and are refundable until the timber is cut. Delivery anywhere in England and Wales is included in the price.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006p-s " data-id="e0006p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006p">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006q-s " data-id="e0006q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006q">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006r-s " data-id="e0006r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006r">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0006s" class="e-ykrhga-e0006s-s e-heading-base">Dining and refectory tables</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006t">Solid top, drawbore or wedged frame, any length to 3.6m</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006u">from 4,800</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006v-s " data-id="e0006v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006v">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006w-s " data-id="e0006w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006w">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0006x" class="e-ykrhga-e0006x-s e-heading-base">Chairs and benches</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006y">Steam-bent or joined, seat woven or shaped, priced each</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006z">from 1,150</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00070 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00070-s " data-id="e00070" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00070">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00071 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00071-s " data-id="e00071" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00071">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00072" class="e-ykrhga-e00072-s e-heading-base">Bookcases and fitted work</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00073-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00073">Scribed to the wall, per run, including fitting</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00074-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00074">from 6,500</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00075 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00075-s " data-id="e00075" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00075">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00076 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00076-s " data-id="e00076" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00076">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00077" class="e-ykrhga-e00077-s e-heading-base">Casegoods — chests, dressers, wardrobes</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00078-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00078">Dovetailed throughout, drawers hand-fitted</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00079-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00079">from 3,900</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007a-s " data-id="e0007a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007a">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007b-s " data-id="e0007b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007b">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0007c" class="e-ykrhga-e0007c-s e-heading-base">Deposit</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007d">A third at drawing stage, refundable until the timber is cut</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007e">one third</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007f-s " data-id="e0007f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007f">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007g-s " data-id="e0007g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007g">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007h">The wait, and why it is that long</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0007i" class="e-ykrhga-e0007i-s e-heading-base">The current wait is about seven months. We will not take more than nine commissions a year, because ten would mean hiring someone and then it would not be our work.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007j">If that is too long, we would rather say so now than rush a piece. We will tell you the true date at the drawing stage and we have not missed one yet.</p>
		
</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007k-s " data-id="e0007k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007k" id="start">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007l e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0007l-s " data-id="e0007l" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0007l">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007m-s " data-id="e0007m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007m">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0007n" class="e-ykrhga-e0007n-s e-heading-base">Start a conversation about a room.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007o">Tell us the room, roughly what it has to do, and when you would like it. We will answer within the week, and if we are not the right workshop for it we will say who is.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007p-s " data-id="e0007p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007p">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007q"><a href="mailto:hello@wrenandash.co.uk" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Start a commission
	</a></p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007r-s " data-id="e0007r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007r">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007s"><a href="mailto:hello@wrenandash.co.uk" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		hello@wrenandash.co.uk
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007t">The workshop, Llanfihangel Crucorney, Monmouthshire</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007u">Visits by arrangement, most Saturdays. Bring the dimensions of the room.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>

</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007v elementor-widget elementor-widget-html" data-id="e0007v" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="html.default">
